OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWidely
OL,6,Fcloudy with patchy light rain and fog
OL,7,Ffor coastal and upland areas. The odd
OL,8,Fshort-lived clear spell may develop in
OL,9,Fthe south. Rain becomes widespread and
OL,10,Flocally heavy into Wednesday morning.
OL,11,FFresh to strong winds. Milder than
OL,12,Frecently.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FOvercast with rain, heavy
OL,15,Fin places, to start. Turning partly
OL,16,Fcloudy with rain clearing east by
OL,17,Fmidday. Mostly dry through the
OL,18,Fafternoon with showers later. Feeling
OL,19,Fwarm with easing winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
